			<div class="content" id="post-content-3916366">
									

<p>I think that's reasonable, and I can definitely understand downvoting an article on that basis.</p>
<p>For my part, I'm very okay with this sort of thing when I'm fairly certain everyone adjacent to it is going to have a good laugh, and I know no one's going to walk away feeling attacked or hurt (which was definitely the case here).</p>
<p>But I also think that disapproving of this on account of feeling like the <em>tone</em> is mean-spirited &#8212; even if no one involved feels targeted or maligned &#8212; is also pretty understandable. Especially if that tone is in-line with hostile articles posted in the past that <em>weren't</em> written purely in good fun and good faith.</p>

